## Review procedure

1. Click each **Content** link above to read the drafted content
2. Click each **ADO** link to see the tracking User Story
3. Verify the deterministic gates
4. Review the model stages for any red flags
5. Decide: accept or reject
6. Comment exactly **`Approved`** or **`Denied`** (just Comment, not Close):
   - **`Approved`** — publishes the content to the live site
   - **`Denied`** — rejects the content

The `orchard-human-review` workflow will:
1. Reply to confirm it received your decision
2. Record the publication or rejection
3. Commit and push the content to the platform repo (on Approve)
4. Update the ADO User Story state
5. Close this issue automatically

You never touch a terminal. Just comment and wait for the confirmation reply.